Thrift Kro database migrations
===============================

New empty database
------------------

Configure ``DATABASE_URL`` and ``SECRET_KEY``, then run::

    alembic upgrade head

Existing pgAdmin database
-------------------------

Do not run the baseline migration directly over an existing database. Verify
the existing schema first (this is read-only)::

    python -m scripts.adopt_existing_database

After taking a database backup, apply the guarded known repairs and stamp the
verified schema::

    python -m scripts.adopt_existing_database --apply

The command requires typing the database name. Use ``--yes`` only in controlled
automation. It never drops, truncates, recreates, or seeds application tables.
